/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Handle missing worktrees before probing them."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"210219d3a287703c1cad7249ce2ce4fe124fb6a2","body":"**Resolve the removal path before checking ownership.**\n\nIn `src/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts:757-783`, a relative `opts.path` can pass the ownership check for one location while Git selects a different worktree by its path suffix. Git can then remove a clean worktree outside `worktreeRoot`. A successful removal can also leave the registry entry unpruned because the comparison uses the raw path.\n\nResolve the path before the ownership check and Git call. Compare the registry entry against the same location, while preserving entries that point elsewhere.","id":"b450c1695068f366d1670976c0ce6672f188532f22552afbe5a945e5a7148b5b","intervals":[[757,783]],"path":"src/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Resolve the removal path before checking ownership."}],"head":"c54bbc04be2cc8eab46869bae0bd8e2fd1c7ede4","head_tree":"508004493f055962e8cda86731fcfbf07ecb0af4","input_scope":[{"blob":"210219d3a287703c1cad7249ce2ce4fe124fb6a2","intervals":[[1,789]],"path":"src/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts"}],"job_id":"4768a54d9f6e184ad779676e8800447fd2476ac89d2374594b7f89113032d4f8:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"210219d3a287703c1cad7249ce2ce4fe124fb6a2","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"210219d3a287703c1cad7249ce2ce4fe124fb6a2","intervals":[[14,14],[53,61],[213,236],[285,285],[466,476],[480,480],[701,701],[737,740],[745,745],[749,749]],"path":"src/adapters/git/prWorktree.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"210219d3a287703